  "method": "CPU native-protocol harness supplies ordered batches/DPI/logical GUI mask and active-touch registry to unmodified original Controls. Original has no touchcancel handler; cancel only changes target registry. Matching preceding emulated mouse packets discarded by adapter policy. playing=false suppresses onFrame and marks new pointer targets GUI, while tracked move/end handlers run. Harness treats the game as one touch target; original DOM per-element targetTouches/hit testing is not modeled. Not execution of Macroquad Stage/subscriber, OS input/focus/GUI hit testing, browser task dispatch or rendering.",
